<!--
  Six indexable pages. Login, register and the 404 are left out to match the
  disallow list in robots.txt, since listing a page here while disallowing it
  there is a contradiction a crawler resolves by ignoring one of the two.

  changefreq and priority are hints a crawler is free to disregard, so they
  are set to describe the site honestly rather than to claim importance: the
  catalogue genuinely changes, the policies genuinely do not. lastmod is the
  date this file and the page content were last edited, and is the one value
  here worth keeping accurate - a stale lastmod teaches a crawler to stop
  trusting the others.
-->
